     "note": "v5: she hurries as a woman does in a long close dress and heels: quick short steps (180 a minute, 0.5 m each) with a forward lean, not a sprint (a captured run was tried: its knee lift and heel kick throw the dress about and through her legs). Built for the game's real running speed (3.3 m/s); the ground her steps do not cover she glides over (owner 12.11)"
