    "rig": "art/agents/elise/cloth_rig.npz",
    "bake": "art/anim/out/elise_cloth.npz",
    "note": "v5: where the dress lies on the body (hips, top of the thighs) it is skin and rides the body's own bones; below it is cloth, simulated against both real legs about a shape carried by the hips and, gently, the legs (cloth_rig.npz `skin`, `tight`). The colliders are the real legs, so the margins are a fabric's thickness, and nothing pulls the cloth back into a leg (v4 kept 70% of every swing); `leash_deg` draws back, inside the simulation, a hem that flies more than 30 degrees off its hang in a lunge (a leg that pushes it still wins). The stairs clips are gone: the game never played them (the town's steps are walked with the walk clip) and a close dress does not climb in place",
